      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Existing in your cities and the countryside and in &hellip;.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>laws and in the (statutes?)...</li>\n<li>A neglected disperse, condemned as useless.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>A few [people], and they are not among us,</li>\n<li>opposing our tradition and our religion,</li>\n<li>Leaving them among us humiliates us.</li>\n<li>and their removal, O master, adorns us.</li>\n<li>For if our master counts the precious,</li>\n<li>He can sell it to me worthless.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
